@startuml state-appointment
!include _style.iuml
title Appointment lifecycle (enforced in domain/Lifecycle.scala)
hide empty description

[*] --> CONFIRMED : customer books
CONFIRMED --> IN_PROGRESS : advisor, admin or the\nassigned technician starts
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : advisor, admin or the\nassigned technician finishes
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : customer before the start time;\nadvisor / admin before work starts
CONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW : advisor / admin,\nafter the start time
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED
  CONFIRMED and IN_PROGRESS hold the bay,
  the technician and the vehicle: the database's
  EXCLUDE constraints apply only to these two.
end note
@enduml
